## Checklist — DECOMPOSE → Impl + Design

На каждый `sNN`: yes → добавь. Cap situational ≤ **4** (+ Impl Core из `workflow-decompose` + Design Core если `yes`).

| # | Вопрос | skill / пакет |
|---|--------|---------------|
| 1 | User-facing JSX/TSX / shell / DS / theme UI? → `visible_ui:` yes\|no | Design Core если **yes** |
| 2 | E2E / user-visible scenario / PW suite в step? | `playwright-best-practices` |
| 3 | Новый Playwright spec с нуля? | `playwright-generate-test` |
| 4 | View Transitions API / transition UX? | `vercel-react-view-transitions` |
| 5 | Web design / a11y guidelines audit в scope? | `web-design-guidelines` |

**Defaults:** user-visible flow → #2 **yes**; новый e2e файл → +#3; pure lib → `visible_ui: no`, Design —, situational часто пусто.

